SUMMARY:Red & White Salsa & Bachata Latin Dance Party & December BDAYS!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🔥 SALSA4LIFE WE
 DNESDAYS 🔥\nSALSA • BACHATA • MERENGUE • LATIN HITS\nCary’s Wed
 nesday night Latin dance social is where the community comes together to D
 ANCE! 💃🏽🕺🏽\n❤️🤍 RED & WHITE LATIN DANCE PARTY — DECEM
 BER BIRTHDAYS! 🤍❤️\n\n🎂🥂 It’s time to celebrate our Decembe
 r birthday babies in style! Join us for a festive night of Latin music\, d
 ancing\, birthday vibes\, and amazing people at Salsa4Life Wednesdays at K
 ŌMANA Brewery! 💃🕺\n\n🎉 Celebrating a December birthday? Send us 
 a DM so we can feature you and make your night extra special!\n\n✨ WHAT
 ’S HAPPENING?\n\n🎶 Salsa & Bachata Lessons | 7:30–8:30 PM\n\n🎁 P
 RIZES & GIVEAWAYS AFTER THE LESSON! 🎉\n\n🔥 Social Dancing | 8:30–1
 1:00 PM\n\n🎧 DJ Giovanni bringing the Latin rhythms!\nSALSA • BACHATA
  • LATIN HITS\n\n🎂 9:30 PM — DECEMBER BIRTHDAY CELEBRATION!\nA spec
 ial Birthday Dance & Celebration for all December birthdays!\n\n🍻 Drink
  Specials • Spacious Dance Floor • Free Parking\n\n❤️🤍 THE THEM
 E: RED & WHITE LATIN DANCE PARTY! 🤍❤️\n\nBring out your best RED & 
 WHITE outfits! ❤️🤍 Dress to impress\, bring your energy\, and get r
 eady for a night filled with Latin rhythms\, great dancing\, laughter\, an
 d unforgettable memories!\n\n📅 Wednesday\, December 2\n\n⏰ 7:30–11:
 00 PM\n\n📍 KŌMANA Brewery\n1020 Ryan Rd\, Cary\, NC\n\n💵 $10 before
  10 PM\n\n🎟️ Early Bird Tickets at Salsa4Life.com\n\nWhether you're c
 elebrating a December birthday or simply coming for the music\, this is YO
 UR invitation to join the Salsa4Life dance family!\n\nTag your dance frien
 ds\, invite your crew\, wear your RED & WHITE\, and let's paint the dance 
 floor with Latin flavor! ❤️🤍💃🕺\n\nONE NIGHT. ONE DANCE FAMILY
 . ALL THE LATIN VIBES! 🔥🎶\n\n🔥 WEEKLY LATIN DANCE SOCIAL\n🔥 BE
 GINNER-FRIENDLY DANCE LESSON\n🔥 SPACIOUS DANCE FLOOR\n🔥 COOL A/C + C
 OMFORTABLE DANCE SPACE + FANS\n🔥 DRINK SPECIALS 🍻\n🔥 FREE PARKING
 \n🔥 DOOR PRIZE GIVEAWAYS 🎁\n🔥 COME SOLO OR BRING YOUR CREW\n🔥 
 GREAT MUSIC • GREAT PEOPLE • LATIN DANCING\nWhether you're brand new t
 o Latin dancing or you've been dancing Salsa and Bachata for years\, Salsa
 4Life Wednesdays is your midweek dance destination!\nCome learn\, meet new
  people\, connect with the community\, and dance the night away. ❤️\n
 🔥 YOUR WEDNESDAY NIGHT PLANS ARE HERE! 🔥\n⏰ 7:15 PM — Doors open
  & meet-and-greet mixer\n💃🏽 7:30–8:30 PM — Salsa & Bachata lesso
 n\n🎁 After class — Free door prize giveaways\n🔥 8:30–11:00 PM 
 — Social dancing\n\n🕺 DJ Giovanni playing the best 🎶 Salsa\, Bacha
 ta\, Merengue and Latin Hits.\n📍 KōMANA Brewing Company\n1020 Ryan Roa
 d\, Cary\, NC\n💵 $10 online and b4 9pm\nTickets: salsa4life.com\n\n🍻
  Drink specials available\nNo partner needed. All levels welcome.\n18+ to 
 party • 21+ to drink\n\n🔥 MAKE WEDNESDAY YOUR NEW FAVORITE NIGHT TO D
 ANCE!\n📤 SHARE with someone who needs more dancing in their life!\nHost
 ed by Salsa4Life.com\n\n#Salsa4Life #Salsa4LifeWednesdays #LatinDance #Sal
 saDancing #BachataDancing #Merengue #LatinMusic #CaryNC #RaleighNC #Triang
 leNC
